cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use warptap in academic or professional work, please cite it as below."
title: warptap
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python library that inserts IEEE 1149.1 (JTAG/TAP) and
  IEEE 1687 (IJTAG) test-access infrastructure into RTL before synthesis,
  emits ICL and PDL, and generates SVF, STAPL and STIL test patterns.
type: software
authors:
